\par
BINCON is designed to be compatible with the work-around mechanism described above to allow rapid addition to existing systems; this mechanism was introduced in P?S/8 Version 8Y and is supported on all newer releases.\par
\par
Usage restrictions.\par
\par
There are no usage restriction associated with BINCON.  The program does not use the =\i xxxx\i0  construction; there is no internal overlay structure within the program.  The program is designed to start at 00200 to be compatible with the default program execution mechanism.\par
